  "_doc": "CLI client conformance (SPEC §7G.10, §7G.11) over conformance/media/fake-cli/fake-cli.sh — see fake-cli/README.md for the exact harness steps. client = grok|codex. Placeholders: {out} the fake's out dir, {dir} gather.dir, {cwd} in expectArgv = must equal <out>/cwd.txt. command (when present) replaces the fake command entirely (spawn-failure case). env is set in the TEST process (the child inherits it; Codex's folder lookup reads it). expectExists / expectMissing: paths that must / must not exist after the run. expectNoSpawn: argv.txt must not exist. maxElapsedMs: the call must return within it (kill on timeout). Other fields as in clients.json.",
